WEBVTT

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:43.120
I'll quickly show you who's 
stronger... You or me.

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:51.250
First Blood.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:56.400
I can take a technique from the first person 
to die in the stage and copy it.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:02.020
<b>Titan Goes Berserk</b>

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:07.100
The Man of the Wind.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:13.640
The technique that weirdo 
with the glasses used?

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:17.040
What good is taking that loser's technique?

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:18.460
You'll find out soon enough.

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:23.410
That loser's technique won't work on me!

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:27.620
Hey, I'm over here.

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:42.580
<i>How stupid is he?</i>

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:45.740
<i>There's no way a loser's 
technique would work on me.</i>

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:52.090
You probably think you're hidden,
 but I know where you are.

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:54.360
There!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.320
Titan!

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.080
Suigin!

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:08.670
What?

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:11.510
I've got you now!

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:23.880
I undid Man of the Wind.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.540
Then that wind...

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:26.780
Was just wind.

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:30.320
You were being led around by my illusion.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.470
Illusion?

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:34.190
Don't mess with me!

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:42.910
Let's stop this now.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:46.490
If you surrender, I won't do anything.

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:57.110
Surrender to someone like you?

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:01.190
I'm one of the chosen elite.

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:05.560
I won't lose to anyone. 
There's nothing I can't do!

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:12.800
Everyone, please give our winner, 
Titan-san a huge round of applause.

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:16.230
It's just a game.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:20.130
Have you heard? That guy's dad
 is supposedly beyond loaded.

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:23.900
I heard he might've even rigged this match.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:26.030
Hey, you poor bastard.

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:28.900
If you want to fight me, come up here.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:32.630
Did you just call me poor? 
Who do you think you are?

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:34.480
Filthy peasants.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:36.680
Why, you...

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.710
Let go of me!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:46.760
Young Master, I gave those 
two about three million yen.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:52.390
I also had them sign agreements 
not to say anything to the press.

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:56.040
Apparently, they tried to 
fight me on purpose.

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:59.950
You are the brightest hope of the family.

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:02.490
Brightest hope of the family my ass.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.640
I can't do anything that I want.

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:05.900
Young Master...

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:10.770
Fine. I'll do what I want, then.

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:14.780
There's nothing in this world 
that can't be solved with money.

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:19.640
This game is all about money anyway,

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:22.590
so I'll just fight using that!

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:31.870
What the?

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:39.610
The Blade of Taiboutan.

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:43.060
This is the ultimate form 
of my Buster Item.

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:45.960
Oh, crap.

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:52.170
Ever since we announced <i>Grave Buster</i>, 
over ten million players have started playing.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.880
With the various in-game purchases 
and high-leveled equipment,

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:59.130
this game is growing faster 
than we ever imagined.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:02.050
Bosses of various stages are being defeated

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:05.100
and the fields are being 
taken over by players.

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:09.520
This is the final stage. 
This is where we get past Zero.

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:14.310
Now then, members of Precious, 
let us take our leave.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:30.370
In this battle that has raged 
for a thousand years,

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:33.580
Precious had been the predominant 
force among the grave robbers.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:37.590
Their leader is a mysterious 
player named Dark Tiger,

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:41.630
who is one of the five Billion Players.

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:46.010
Dark Tiger also has a upper 
echelon of sixteen members

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:50.250
and their assets are said 
to exceed two billion.

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:57.560
Ah, it's been a while.

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:03.460
Dark Tiger-sama, we're now 
ready to conquer Zero.

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:06.740
We will follow your every command.

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:11.960
How are the preparations for the 
festival on stage 18 tomorrow?

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:15.910
I've emailed the transfer rings 
to all of the players.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:19.610
They will also act as a repellent and 
defeat any of the weaker players.

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:22.570
However, there is one 
thing that concerns me.

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:23.590
What is that?

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.720
We thought we had disposed of all 
of the tomb guardians,

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:33.150
but a moment ago, the number on 
that scale went from zero to one.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:38.000
Which means a new tomb 
guardian has appeared.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:41.110
What should we do with
 the remaining tomb guardian?

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:45.030
No matter who they are, kill them.

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:55.160
Are you watching, Dad?

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:56.910
I'm strong.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:00.360
I'm ruthless.

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:04.840
I'm... chosen!

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:08.130
I have more money than 
I know what to do with!

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:10.970
I'm going to put the max of a 
hundred million into this!

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:14.010
I'll kill you both in an instant!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.180
Charge complete!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.630
You small fry will die a suitable death!

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:33.360
We're finished.

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:38.160
It's okay. I'm here.

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:40.400
What are you doing?

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:41.790
If you want to hit us,

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:44.750
hit me first!

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:46.780
Suigin, don't!

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:49.130
You're a poor student who works all the time.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:52.260
Your assets are no match for his.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:58.580
You stupid part-timer! 
Get out of this game!

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:00.290
We made a promise, didn't we, Farin?

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:03.900
You'll join my team if I win.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:12.880
That's... impossible...

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:19.210
I charged a hundred million into this...

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:23.290
There's no way... a stupid part-timer...

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:26.000
could have that much money!

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:30.300
How do you have so much?

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:35.990
I can't disclose that information, 
but now Titan's assets are zero.

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:37.260
Pretty sure he's going under.

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:40.510
So this game is going to be forced to end.

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:41.830
Which means...

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:44.480
The item's going to explode!

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:47.690
The more money put into the item, 
the bigger the explosion...

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:58.620
Hey, could you get off of me?

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:02.700
Um... we just have to log out, right?

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:05.050
But my Seabay...

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:10.630
I can't reach mine, either.

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:13.140
I'm sure someone will come 
to save us eventually.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:15.090
Eventually?

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:16.900
How could you be so carefree?

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:22.950
I-If you do anything weird, I'll kill you!

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.150
Before you log off, tell me.

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:32.890
You have some kind of ability to analyze 
your opponent's Buster Item, right?

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:34.690
So what if I do?

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.320
That's a really amazing ability!

00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:38.260
Huh?

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:43.760
I know you have other friends, 
but I really want you on my team.

00:10:44.150 --> 00:10:46.400
This is all really sudden...

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:48.680
Could you think about it?

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:53.350
I know. I'll put my address 
into your Seabay.

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:54.180
Riku Suigin

00:10:54.790 --> 00:10:57.610
I have too many people in my address book.

00:10:57.610 --> 00:11:00.260
Then... Oh, yeah...

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.910
Ow...

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.830
What is that?

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:20.570
What kind of carriage is that?

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:25.720
Be careful. I feel really intense 
pressure coming from inside.

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:29.370
Hello, there.

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:37.370
Farin, that was the end of 
the beginner's course, right?

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.700
Y-Yeah...

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:40.380
Then this carriage...

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:45.770
<b>A Bewildered Suigin</b>

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:48.180
I've finally found you.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:52.640
To think I'd find you in the beginner's 
course area flirting with a loli...

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:56.110
Not bad, Riku Suigin.

00:11:57.660 --> 00:12:00.340
She knows your name. Do you know her?

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:03.350
No, but there's something I want to ask her.

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:06.080
Wait! It's too dangerous! Suigin!

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:07.250
No!

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:13.000
Why are you so worried 
about me all of a sudden?

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.080
She's not normal.

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:21.050
I used my Probing Eye to scan her 
abilities, but there's no data.

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:28.320
A player with a Divine Tomb weapon, 
will have a flame-like aura around them.

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:32.180
Players should only be able 
to have one Divine Tomb item each,

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:34.400
but she has ten!

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:40.200
I heard the only person to have this ability 
was one of the Billion Players, the Collector!

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:45.410
You've got a rare ability there, missy.

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:49.550
A Billion Player? 
What's someone like that doing here?

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:54.910
That's a wonderful ability, 
but too much knowledge is dangerous.

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:08.690
Farin!

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:13.620
Th-That's...

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:16.150
Don't worry. She'll be fine.

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:17.790
What did you do to her?

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:21.060
The bullet I shot at her 
is only a plushy bullet.

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:22.080
She didn't suffer any damage.

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:25.700
But she will be unconscious 
for the next two minutes.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.440
I wanted some alone time with you.

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:31.530
What are you after? Tell me!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:37.610
I'm glad you accepted that. 
That's a special present just for you.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:43.720
Don't worry. You might not like it,
 but I hope you'll be nice.

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:47.130
What is this? It's all sticky...

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:53.640
What the hell is this?! Get off my face!

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:57.930
Jeez. Can't you be nicer to my present?

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:01.980
It's so anxious to become one with you.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.710
Become one with me?

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:05.800
Don't tell me—

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.120
It went into my mouth! Gross!

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.300
That little one is called a sausage dragon.

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:23.240
It's a grave beast that 
enters players' bodies.

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:26.230
It's also your key to saving Riku Rei.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:30.510
Riku Rei? Do you know where she is?

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:34.550
She's in the hands of the 
Totems' leader, Temujin.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.690
If you want to save her,

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:39.490
do not believe the Temujin 
that you're about to meet.

00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:41.710
Use Temujin.

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:43.660
When you get into the Totems' headquarters,

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:47.490
that thing will tell you 
exactly how to save Riku Rei.

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:49.950
This is our little secret.

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:53.040
The walls have ears. Be careful.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:04.300
Riku Suigin, no matter what that 
man says, do not believe him.

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:07.090
And why should I believe you?

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:10.350
It's the beginning of the end.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.050
Let's go.

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:17.470
Hey! I'm not done talking to you yet!

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:19.650
Where's Temujin?

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:22.980
Don't worry.

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:28.400
Even if you don't know where 
he is, they'll all come to you.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:33.750
Huh?

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:37.840
That's her true power?

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:50.300
Farin! You're awake.

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:53.140
Are you okay?

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:55.250
What just happened?

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:57.310
The Collector's gone now.

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:59.620
So what was she after?

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:01.860
I'm not really sure myself.

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:05.530
But apparently someone else does.

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:17.560
How long has he been following us?

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:20.650
Was he the ears on the walls that 
the Collector was talking about?

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:24.390
Wait. I'll probe his ability.

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:28.480
I told you not to let them spot you. 
Now look what happened.

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:31.770
The boss told us to monitor them secretly.

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:35.080
How are we supposed to do that 
now that they spotted us?

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:36.720
Then we'll just have to kill them.

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:38.480
Are you broken in the head?

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:40.310
How are we supposed to monitor 
them if they're dead?

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:43.280
There's something strange 
about that square owl.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:44.480
Don't let your guard down.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:49.340
He doesn't have a Divine Tomb weapon, 
but his power is on par with Wild Wolf.

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:52.460
He might actually be stronger than Wild Wolf.

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:56.240
What? He's one of the Totems.

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:00.080
If he's one of the Totems, 
then he'd know about Temujin...

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:02.460
and know where Riku Rei is!

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:04.620
Wait a second, Suigin!

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:08.520
That reckless idiot! He's heading this way!

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:10.150
Let's hurry up and go!

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:12.700
Can we really not kill them?

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:15.970
You idiot! He's valuable 
to the boss! Let's go!

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:19.020
Hey, wait!

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:24.350
Where's Riku Rei? Tell me!

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:33.690
What was that move you just used?

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:37.120
You managed to catch up to me so quickly.

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:41.250
What a persistent brat. Don't get excited.

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:46.630
You're one of the Totems, right? 
Is Riku Rei with them?

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:49.810
Nothing in my orders stated 
that I had to answer you.

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:54.520
There's no way that the speed of 
my wind will let you get away!

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.810
You fool.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:00.520
He disappeared?!

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:06.240
You're slow.

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:12.050
I won't be able to fight him like this!

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:17.420
Too slow.

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:18.920
Damn it!

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:24.450
<i>Crap! I can't run away!</i>

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:26.340
Xiao shi ba.

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:30.860
I forgot there was another nuisance.

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:32.420
Farin!

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:36.610
What are you just standing there for? 
If you can't win, hurry up and run!

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:40.550
Now that you've got me all worked up, 
I won't let the two of you escape.

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:45.350
He's too fast.

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:48.680
Are you stupid? He's one of the 
upper echelon of the Totems!

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:50.910
There's no way you'd win that easily!

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:53.350
Then why'd you come save me?

00:18:53.350 --> 00:18:58.630
A-As a member of your team, 
I can't just let you die.

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:03.090
Thanks. Now you're truly a member of my team.

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:05.790
Farin, I'll protect you.

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:07.040
Here he comes!

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:10.960
Crap! The speed of this attack is unreal!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.350
I can't keep up with my strike rank.

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:18.060
Damn it. If I don't log off, 
I can't reset my item's abilities.

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:30.870
You slashed them quite a bit, 
so I think we're done.

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:35.630
I thought he'd be stronger since 
the boss was interested in him.

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:36.740
He's too weak.

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:40.410
I'm bored now. I'm going to finish 
them and we're going back.

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:46.430
What's this weird number? 
Is that how many times we were cut?

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:51.090
I'm not sure... But there might be 
some kind of magical effect on it.

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:53.100
It has to mean something.

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:56.760
I guess we won't know if we don't try!

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:04.520
He missed?

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:09.860
What's going on? Now it says 33.

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:13.560
You, too.

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:16.240
At that speed...

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:24.660
I see. If you're cut a certain amount of 
times, the game forces you to log out.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:29.040
Though finding that out 
now won't do you any good.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.970
What? I deflected his attack, so why...

00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:36.810
Stupid girl. It's no use dodging it.

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:38.010
Disappear.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:50.540
Damn it. That stupid cheater.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:54.370
I can't log in again for 24 hours 
after being forced to log out.

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:58.320
Farin

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:58.320
Farin

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:58.320
Farin got booted, too?

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.700
Incoming Call...

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:04.190
Hello? Is that you, Farin?

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:11.370
Ah, so your new girlfriend's 
name is Farin, Riku Suigin?

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:12.510
Who are you?

